# `fm footman tools provision` throwaway prefix
.tools-latest/

# `fm tools.gather` observation documents. A gather writes what one
# machine saw, for folding on one machine — the document is the handoff,
# not a tracked artefact, and a stale one in the tree is a picture of
# whichever laptop last ran it.
obs-*.json

# The profile plugin's default output: a picture of one run on one
# machine, regenerated by the next `fm --profile` — never a tracked file.
fm-profile.json
